;; reach is both read and written by its own rules (self-recursive SCC
;; over a graph containing the cycle 1->2->3->1 plus 3->4), then read by
;; two downstream strata (samecycle and from1).

table (edge int int)
table (reach int int)
table (samecycle int int)
table (from1 int)

facts
(edge 1 2)
(edge 2 3)
(edge 3 1)
(edge 3 4)

rule (edge X Y) --> (reach X Y)
rule (reach X Y) (edge Y Z) --> (reach X Z)

rule (reach X Y) (reach Y X) --> (samecycle X Y)
rule (reach 1 Y) --> (from1 Y)
